# Bounded container build context for the demonstration handle authority
# (demo/public-authority/railway/Dockerfile). Everything the locked build
# needs is Cargo.toml/Cargo.lock, rust-toolchain.toml, src/, and the
# public-authority artifact; everything heavy or irrelevant is excluded.
